---
// YouTubeCompliance.astro - Policy matrix & protected upload station
---
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8">
  
  <!-- Left: Policy Matrix (7 cols) -->
  <div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col gap-6">
    <div class="liquid-glass p-8 rounded-3xl">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-white flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
        <span class="text-emerald-400">🛡️</span> YouTube 2026 AI Policy Compliance Matrix
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mono mb-6">Guaranteed safety guardrails applied to every generated video</p>

      <div class="space-y-4">
        
        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl liquid-glass-subtle border border-emerald-500/30 flex items-start gap-4">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-base">
            ✓
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1">
            <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider">Synthetic Media Notice Injected</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
              Every description explicitly incorporates official YouTube AI disclosure metadata notifying viewers of synthetic voice narration and computer-generated visuals.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl liquid-glass-subtle border border-emerald-500/30 flex items-start gap-4">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-base">
            ✓
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1">
            <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider">Transformative Original Narration</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
              Scripts are custom written with educational analysis, original hooks, and retention pacing—avoiding robotic repetition or reused content flags.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl liquid-glass-subtle border border-emerald-500/30 flex items-start gap-4">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-base">
            ✓
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1">
            <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider">Local-First Private Publishing Gate</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
              Uploads default strictly to <code class="text-cyan-400">private</code> status. No video goes public without explicit manual creator review and verification.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl liquid-glass-subtle border border-emerald-500/30 flex items-start gap-4">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-base">
            ✓
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1">
            <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider">Strict YouTube Metadata Validation</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
              Titles capped at ≤ 100 characters, tags sanitized, and category defaulted to Science & Tech (Category ID 28).
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Right: Upload Station (5 cols) -->
  <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col gap-6">
    <div class="liquid-glass p-8 rounded-3xl">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
        <span>🚀</span> YouTube Data API v3 Gateway
      </h2>

      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div>
          <label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-400 mb-2">Target Video File</label>
          <select id="uploadVideoSelect" class="w-full bg-slate-900 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl px-4 py-3 text-xs text-slate-200 focus:outline-none focus:border-cyan-400">
            <option value="y2k38_viral_short.mp4">y2k38_viral_short.mp4 (72.1s • 44.0 MB)</option>
          </select>
        </div>

        <div>
          <label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-400 mb-2">Publish Privacy Status</label>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2">
            <label class="cursor-pointer border border-cyan-400 bg-cyan-950/40 p-2.5 rounded-xl text-center text-xs font-bold text-cyan-300">
              <input type="radio" name="privacy" value="private" checked class="hidden">
              🔒 Private
            </label>
            <label class="cursor-pointer border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/40 p-2.5 rounded-xl text-center text-xs font-bold text-slate-300">
              <input type="radio" name="privacy" value="unlisted" class="hidden">
              🔗 Unlisted
            </label>
            <label class="cursor-pointer border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/40 p-2.5 rounded-xl text-center text-xs font-bold text-slate-300">
              <input type="radio" name="privacy" value="public" class="hidden">
              🌍 Public
            </label>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/70 border border-white/5 space-y-2 text-xs">
          <div class="flex justify-between text-slate-400">
            <span>OAuth2 Client Secrets:</span>
            <span class="text-amber-400 mono">client_secrets.json</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between text-slate-400">
            <span>Target Channel:</span>
            <span class="text-slate-200 font-semibold">Creator Studio Auth</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <button onclick="triggerUpload()" class="w-full py-4 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-red-600 via-rose-600 to-indigo-600 hover:from-red-500 hover:to-indigo-500 text-white font-extrabold text-sm tracking-wide shadow-xl shadow-red-600/30 transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
          <span>🔺</span> Publish Video to YouTube Data API
        </button>

        <div id="uploadStatusBox" class="hidden p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 border border-white/10 text-xs mono text-cyan-300">
          Ready.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>
